  "details": "When standing near a active mirror just lightly sliding your finger on the screen where the mirror is it moves you to actively view the mirror, even if you aren’t in front of it or tapping on it but just looking to the side and constantly clicking out can get annoying. Might not be the biggest issue since a lot of worlds use buttons to activate and deactivate mirrors but for those that are automatically activated this can cause some headaches.",
